  "extra_vbs": "'---- PAD (PAD-905): John Wick's switches the shadow game kept for its missions\nTenemy7.Enabled = 1 : Tkatia.Enabled = 1          ' the skill shot, in the shooter lane\nTargetsave.Collidable = 1                        ' MID RIGHT TGT BOT\nTpostG.Enabled = 0 : TpostD.Enabled = 0          ' the machine has no return lane posts\n'---- the LE's mechs: the diverter on the center ramp sends the ball to the\n' lock behind the arch (Karche, LOCK 1-3, the post), and the pops' drop target\nSub PadDiverter(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tguideramp.RotZ = -50 : guideramp.Collidable = 0 : guideramp1.Collidable = 1\n\tElse\n\t\tguideramp.RotZ = 0 : guideramp.Collidable = 1 : guideramp1.Collidable = 0\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\nSub PadLockPost(e) : lockarche.IsDropped = CBool(e) : PadHeldKarche_Sol e : End Sub\nSub Targetclub_Dropped : Controller.Switch(1081) = True : End Sub\nSub Targetclub_Raised : Controller.Switch(1081) = False : End Sub\nSub PadDropTrip(e) : If e Then Targetclub.IsDropped = 1 : PlaySoundAt \"fx_droptarget\", Targetclub : End If : End Sub\nSub PadDropReset(e) : If e Then Targetclub.IsDropped = 0 : PlaySoundAt \"fx_resetdrop\", Targetclub : End If : End Sub\n",
  "retrofit_timers": {"PinMAMETimer": {"clone": "PulseTimer", "interval_ms": 1}, "PadTestTimer": {"clone": "PulseTimer", "interval_ms": 100}},
